# Copy to .env (untracked) in the main checkout. Superset workspaces copy it in.

# Google OAuth client built into the app, so "Sign in with Google" works on a
# fresh install without the Cloud console. Google Cloud → APIs & Services →
# Credentials → your OAuth client (Web application, redirect URI
# http://127.0.0.1:17248). The Gmail API must be enabled in the same project,
# and the app published (Audience → Publish app) — in "Testing" Google blocks
# non-test-users with 403 access_denied and expires sign-ins after 7 days.
# A client entered in Settings → Accounts → Google API always wins.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
